{
 "title": "Cold Open",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Cold Open",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s00i01",
     "text": "On September 30th, Russia sent NATO a *warning*:",
     "shot": "map:kalin",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "date": 2026
    },
    {
     "id": "s00i02",
     "text": "try to cut off Kaliningrad, and Moscow could use *nuclear* weapons.",
     "shot": "map:kalin",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tech_hit",
       "w:nuclear",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s00i03",
     "text": "NATO says *no* blockade is planned.",
     "shot": "map:kalin",
     "type": "INSERT"
    },
    {
     "id": "s00i04",
     "text": "So why would the *biggest* country on Earth threaten nuclear war",
     "shot": "in_ratio",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tech_fill",
       4,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s00i05",
     "text": "over a piece of land less than *one-thousandth* of its size?",
     "shot": "in_ratio",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "tech_chime",
       "w:one-thousandth",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s00i06",
     "text": "Because Russia has been afraid of the same thing for *eight* hundred years.",
     "shot": "in_fear",
     "type": "HOST"
    },
    {
     "id": "s00i07",
     "text": "And stay to the end,",
     "shot": "in_promise",
     "type": "HOST"
    },
    {
     "id": "s00i08",
     "text": "because there's one set of numbers the Kremlin quietly *stopped* publishing…",
     "shot": "in_promise",
     "type": "HOST",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:stopped",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s00i09",
     "text": "that may *scare* it even more.",
     "shot": "in_promise",
     "type": "HOST",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:more",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b01",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Look at Russia on a map.",
     "shot": "co_look",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:map",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b02",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It barely looks real.",
     "shot": "map:size",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b03",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It covers more than *17* million square kilometres.",
     "shot": "map:size",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:million",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b04",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "That's over a *tenth* of all the land on Earth.",
     "shot": "map:size"
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b05",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It stretches across *11* time zones.",
     "shot": "map:size",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:time",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b06",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "When people in Kaliningrad sit down to dinner,",
     "shot": "map:size",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Kaliningrad",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b07",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "people in Kamchatka are already waking up *tomorrow*.",
     "shot": "map:size",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Kamchatka",
       0.5
      ],
      [
       "ding",
       "w:tomorrow",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b08",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But here is the strange part.",
     "shot": "co_strange",
     "gag": false
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b09",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Most Russians live in only a *small* corner of it.",
     "shot": "map:people"
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b10",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Roughly *three-quarters* of the population is packed into the European west.",
     "shot": "map:people"
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b11",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The rest of the country is an ocean of forest,",
     "shot": "map:people",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b12",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "mountains, and frozen river, with very few people per square kilometre.",
     "shot": "map:people",
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b15",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "That *one* problem explains a surprising amount of Russian history.",
     "shot": "co_problem"
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b16",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It explains why Russia kept expanding.",
     "shot": "co_problem",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:expanding",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b17",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Why its rulers chained farmers to the land.",
     "shot": "co_problem",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:chained",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b18",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And why a country with all that space has always felt so *afraid*.",
     "shot": "co_problem",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:afraid",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b19",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But it points to something *darker*, too.",
     "shot": "co_darker",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b20",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Again and again, Russia's rulers have solved the problem of holding all that land",
     "shot": "co_scales",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b21",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "by *spending* people to do it.",
     "shot": "co_scales",
     "quiet": true,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:people",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b22",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Serfs.",
     "shot": "co_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b23",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Famine victims.",
     "shot": "co_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b24",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Prisoners.",
     "shot": "co_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b25",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Soldiers.",
     "shot": "co_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b26",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Tens of *millions* of them.",
     "shot": "co_spent",
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b27",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And now that bill is coming due, in the one place *no* tank can reach.",
     "shot": "co_tank",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       0,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "slam",
       "w:reach",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b28",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The *birth* rate.",
     "shot": "co_birthrate",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       4,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b29",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "To see how a small forest settlement ended up here,",
     "shot": "co_rewind",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b30",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "we have to go back more than a *thousand* years.",
     "shot": "co_rewind",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:back",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s01b31",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "To a country with *no* walls.",
     "shot": "co_nowalls",
     "date": 880,
     "amb": "wind"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}